    "precedence": [
      "MOVE_READY before deadline is accepted",
      "legal MOVE_READY exactly at deadline is accepted and outranks a timeout event with the same timestamp regardless of callback delivery order",
      "MOVE_READY after deadline or no MOVE_READY by deadline is timeout",
      "a malformed or illegal complete line strictly before deadline terminates with its typed protocol_failure or illegal_move reason",
      "unactionable input at the exact deadline does not outrank timeout",
      "increment and state transition occur only after an accepted MOVE_READY wins arbitration",
      "late, incomplete, malformed or illegal input creates no history record"
